<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Sneaker World</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="ker.css">
</head>
<body>
    <header>
        <h1>Sneaker World</h1>
        <p>Explore the coolest sneakers!</p>
    </header>

    <section class="sneakers">
        <div class="sneaker-card">
            <img src="sneaker1.jpg" alt="Sneaker 1">
            <h2>Air Max 90</h2>
            <p>Classic comfort and timeless design. A favorite since 1990!</p>
        </div>

        <div class="sneaker-card">
            <img src="sneaker2.jpg" alt="Sneaker 2">
            <h2>Yeezy Boost 350</h2>
            <p>Modern style meets supreme comfort. Iconic in every step.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="sneaker-card">
            <img src="sneaker3.jpg" alt="Sneaker 3">
            <h2>Jordan 1 Retro</h2>
            <p>The sneaker that changed the game. Bold and legendary.</p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <footer>
        <p>© 2025 Sneaker World. All rights reserved.</p>
    </footer>
</body>
</html>
